     \"desc\": \"A colossal mysterious giant entity occupying the entire right side of the ultra-wide frame, larger than a mountain. Its surface looks like ancient stone mixed with organic armor, with subtle cracks, worn textures, and faint blue light inside the seams. The giant leans slightly toward the little girl, creating a silent face-to-face confrontation. It should feel divine, ancient, and overwhelming rather than like a normal monster.\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\n          \"#111820\",\n          \"#2E4155\",\n          \"#6E7F8D\",\n          \"#AFC7D9\",\n          \"#0D0D0F\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [\n          150,\n          600,\n          430,\n          960\n        ],\n        \"desc\": \"The upper head and face-like structure of the colossal entity, partially hidden in fog and shadow. The face is not fully human, with abstract ancient features, deep eye cavities, and faint glowing cracks. It looks down toward the little girl with quiet, unreadable intelligence.\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\n          \"#0D0D0F\",\n          \"#1D2A36\",\n          \"#AFC7D9\",\n          \"#D7E6F2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [\n          590,\n          360,\n          860,\n          470\n        ],\n        \"desc\": \"A tiny little girl standing alone near the center-left of the wide frame, facing the giant entity. She wears a simple pale dress and has a small fragile silhouette. Her posture is calm but tense, one arm raised toward the giant. She should look extremely small compared to the colossal entity, emphasizing the scale contrast.\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\n          \"#D7E6F2\",\n          \"#C8B9A6\",\n          \"#1A1A1A\",\n          \"#AFC7D9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [\n          535,\n          455,\n          660,\n          590\n        ],\n        \"desc\": \"The moment of contact between the little girl's raised hand and the giant entity's massive surface. Her fingertips gently touch the cold stone-like skin, creating a faint circular glow and tiny particles of light. The gesture should feel quiet, sacred, and tense, not violent.\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\n          \"#D7E6F2\",\n          \"#AFC7D9\",\n          \"#6E7F8D\",\n          \"#FFFFFF\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"bbox\": [\n          110,\n          55,\n          270,\n          420\n        ],\n        \"text\": \"巨影对峙\",\n        \"desc\": \"Large bold readable Chinese movie title typography placed on the left side of the ultra-wide poster, elegant white characters with subtle cold blue glow, premium cinematic spacing, no distorted characters, no extra random text.\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\n          \"#F8FAFC\",\n          \"#AFC7D9\",\n          \"#D7E6F2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"bbox\": [\n          310,\n          65,\n          410,\n          430\n        ],\n        \"text\": \"当渺小触碰神明，命运开始转动\",\n        \"desc\": \"Readable smaller Chinese tagline placed below the main title, clean modern sans-serif style, calm and premium, high contrast, no misspelled characters.\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\n          \"#D7E6F2\",\n          \"#AFC7D9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"bbox\": [\n          805,\n          65,\n          900,\n          390\n        ],\n        \"text\": \"史诗奇幻电影概念海报\",\n        \"desc\": \"Small readable Chinese footer text placed in the lower left, subtle and elegant, integrated into the poster layout, no extra text.\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\n          \"#AFC7D9\",\n          \"#6E7F8D\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 264, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 724, "type": 