s": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "⑥ 输出区说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#12334a", "size": [620, 170], "pos": [9700.5869140625, -270.3162536621094], "id": 214, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["宽高输入会自动对齐到 16 的倍数，并且最低不小于 256，避免 Ideogram 4 分辨率不合法。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "⑦ 尺寸处理区说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#234023", "size": [1120, 150], "pos": [3400.5869140625, 1679.683349609375], "id": 215, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["Quality = 48步质量优先；Default = 20步平衡；Turbo = 12步速度优先。建议先 Default 跑通。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "⑧ 质量预设区说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#4a3515", "size": [1160, 160], "pos": [3400.5869140625, 2779.68408203125], "id": 216, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## 后续封装 AI 应用时优先开放\n\n- prompt / JSON prompt\n- width / height / ratio\n- noise_seed\n- mode：Default / Quality / Turbo\n- 主模型文件选择\n- unconditional 模型文件选择\n\n## 不建议普通用户乱动\n\n- CFGOverride\n- Scheduler mu / std\n- ConditioningZeroOut\n- DualModelGuider 连接关系"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "推荐改动位置", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#2f2138", "size": [920, 400], "pos": [7100.58740234375, 3019.68408203125], "id": 217, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## 模型下载与存放路径（本地用户）\n\n这个工作流需要 5 个核心文件。先把模型放对目录，再拖入 workflow 运行。\n\n### VAE\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n### diffusion_models\n- [ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n- [ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\n### text_encoders\n- [qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3-VL/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n- [gemma4_e4b_it_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/gemma-4/resolve/main/text_encoders/gemma4_e4b_it_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\n### 存放结构\n```text\nComfyUI/\n└── models/\n    ├── vae/\n    │   └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n    ├── diffusion_models/\n    │   ├── ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n    │   └── ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n    └── text_encoders/\n        ├── qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n        └── gemma4_e4b_it_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n```\n\n### 运行前提醒\n- 先更新 ComfyUI。\n- 本地模型缺失时，节点会红色报错。\n- 这个开放权重协议是非商用，商业用途要单独确认授权。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "① 模型下载与存放路径", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#0b1f33", "size": [900, 1050], "pos": [-2849.4130859375, 139.68374633789062], "id": 99, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## Ideogram 4 工作流说明\n\n这个流程是 Ideogram 4 文生图流程，重点不是普通写实图，而是：\n\n- 海报设计\n- 标题文字图\n- Logo / 品牌视觉\n- 封面图\n- 有明确布局的设计图\n\n### 提示词结构\nIdeogram 4 更适合结构化 JSON caption。普通自然语言也能跑，但 JSON prompt 对布局、颜色、文字和元素位置更稳定。\n\n### 双模型引导原理\n流程里有两个模型分支：\n\n- 主模型：读取 prompt，负责“听话”。\n- unconditional 模型：不看 prompt，负责提供基准线。\n- DualModelGuider：对比两者差异，把生成方向推向提示词目标。\n\n### 安全提示\n如果出现 “Image blocked by safety filter”，这是模型训练自带的安全行为，不是 ComfyUI 额外加的过滤器。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "② Ideogram 4 模型机制说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#122a20", "size": [900, 780], "pos": [-1499.4124755859375, 139.68374633789062], "id": 100, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## JSON Prompt 辅助模板说明\n\n这个区域不是直接生成图片的主流程，而是帮助你把普通想法整理成 Ideogram 4 更容易理解的结构化 JSON prompt。\n\n建议用法：\n1. 在 user_prompt 输入你的口语描述。\n2. 复制右侧输出的 JSON prompt。\n3. 粘贴回主流程 prompt。\n4. 再运行主流程生成图片。\n\n如果安装 / 更新 KJNodes，也可以尝试使用 **Ideogram 4 Prompt Builder KJ** 节点做可视化提示词控制。\n\n注意：JSON 的字段名建议保持英文，不要全部汉化，否则可能影响 schema 兼容和模型理解。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "⑧ 模板说明：如何把口语描述变成 JSON", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [700, 460], "pos": [4550.58740234375, 1039.683349609375], "id": 176, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [278], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [540, 540], "pos": [-153.35812377929688, 575.5223999023438], "widgets_values": ["{\n  \"Quality\": {\n    \"num_steps\": 48,\n    \"mu\": 0.0,\n    \"std\": 1.5,\n    \"preset_id\": \"V4_QUALITY_48\"\n  },\n  \"Default\": {\n    \"num_steps\": 20,\n    \"mu\": 0.0,\n    \"std\": 1.75,\n    \"preset_id\": \"V4_DEFAULT_20\"\n  },\n  \"Turbo\": {\n    \"num_steps\": 12,\n    \"mu\": 0.5,\n    \"std\": 1.75,\n    \"preset_id\": \"V4_TURBO_12\"\n  }\n}", "Quality"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "json_string"}, "name": "json_string", "label": "json_string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "json_string"}, {"widget": {"name": "key"}, "name": "key", "label": "key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "key"}], "flags": {}, "id": 199, "type": "JsonExtractString", "title": "质量预设表：Quality / Default / Turbo", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.23.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "JsonExtractString", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [306, 725], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [307, 726], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [460, 190], "pos": [-74.23371124267578, 176.22622680664062], "widgets_values": ["21:9 (Ult